<div class="page-head"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow-l">About</div>
  <h1>Poornima University</h1>
</div></div>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="split">
    <div>
      <p class="lead">Poornima University (PU) is a state private university in Jaipur, India, established by an act of the Rajasthan legislature. PU was established in 2012 with a vision to create a knowledge-based society with scientific temper, team spirit and dignity of labour to face global competition and challenges.</p>
      <p class="lead">PU is recognized by the University Grants Commission (UGC) under Section 2(f) and 12(B) with the right to confer degrees as per Section 22(1) of the UGC Act, 1956. Its architecture programme is approved by the Council of Architecture (CoA) and the hotel management programme by NCHMCT.</p>
      <p class="lead">Currently, PU has more than 11,000 students in eight schools from all over the country enrolled in UG, PG and PhD programmes across Management, Engineering, Computer Application Sciences, Architecture, Design, Public Health and Hotel Management.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="figure"><img src="/images/venue.jpg" alt="Academic Block, Poornima University"></div>
      <div class="figcap">Academic Block · Poornima University, Jaipur</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top:36px">Awards, Rankings &amp; Recognitions</h3>
  <ul class="bul">
    <% awards.forEach(function(a) { %>
      <li><%= a %></li>
    <% }); %>
  </ul>
</div></section>
